{"lines": [{"text": "Your phone charger switches the power on and off over a hundred thousand times a second.", "start": 0.3, "end": 5.294}, {"text": "Here's why.", "start": 5.594, "end": 6.356}, {"text": "Your outlet pushes a hundred and twenty volts, flipping direction sixty times a second. Your battery wants about four volts, flowing one way.", "start": 6.706, "end": 15.345}, {"text": "So first, the charger turns that back-and-forth current into one direction.", "start": 15.645, "end": 19.851}, {"text": "Then a tiny switch chops it into rapid pulses, and a transformer steps the voltage down.", "start": 20.151, "end": 25.44}, {"text": "The faster it switches, the smaller that transformer can be. That's why new chargers made with gallium nitride are so small.", "start": 25.79, "end": 33.424}, {"text": "But no charger is perfect. It loses up to about a tenth of the energy, and all of it turns into heat.", "start": 33.774, "end": 40.01}, {"text": "That's the warmth you feel when you touch it.", "start": 40.31, "end": 42.191}], "total": 42.191, "words": [{"w": "Your", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.579, "line": 0}, {"w": "phone", "s": 0.579, "e": 0.908, "line": 0}, {"w": "charger", "s": 0.908, "e": 1.339, "line": 0}, {"w": "switches", "s": 1.339, "e": 1.821, "line": 0}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.821, "e": 2.049, "line": 0}, {"w": "power", "s": 2.049, "e": 2.379, "line": 0}, {"w": "on", "s": 2.379, "e": 2.556, "line": 0}, {"w": "and", "s": 2.556, "e": 2.784, "line": 0}, {"w": "off", "s": 2.784, "e": 3.012, "line": 0}, {"w": "over", "s": 3.012, "e": 3.291, "line": 0}, {"w": "100,000", "s": 3.291, "e": 4.331, "line": 0}, {"w": "times", "s": 4.331, "e": 4.66, "line": 0}, {"w": "a", "s": 4.66, "e": 4.787, "line": 0}, {"w": "second.", "s": 4.787, "e": 5.294, "line": 0}, {"w": "Here's", "s": 5.594, "e": 5.961, "line": 1}, {"w": "why.", "s": 5.961, "e": 6.356, "line": 1}, {"w": "Your", "s": 6.706, "e": 7.004, "line": 2}, {"w": "outlet", "s": 7.004, "e": 7.41, "line": 2}, {"w": "pushes", "s": 7.4